<title>UK: Merrill Lynch leads asset-backed FRN for MBNA.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch leads asset-backed FRN for MBNA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch has lead-managed a</p>
<p>two-tranche credit card asset-backed FRN for MBNA 1997-C.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MBNA 1997-C</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $637.5 MLN    SPREAD+11-12 BP AREA LEG MAT     15.AUG.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  EXP MAT     17.MAR.04</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   LAW	  NEW YORK  PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> TAX	  STD	 DENOMS     ONE	 SALE LIMITS GLOBAL</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B</p>
<p> AMT    $56.25 MLN    SPREAD  +30 BP AREA  LEG MAT     15.AUG.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 1M LIBOR  EXP MAT     17.MAR.04</p>
<p>MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/A+</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
